# Frontend environment.
# Copy to `.env` to point the portal at your real backend API.
#
# When this is UNSET, the app runs in prototype mode using the mock data in
# src/data/mockData.ts (no backend needed). When SET, every screen loads live
# data from your SQL Server-backed API instead — no code changes required.

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api
